<rml>
<head>
    <title>Drumsmith — Practice</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="Drumsmith.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="Library.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="Practice.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="library-page" data-model="practice_menu">
    <div class="library-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="library-header">
        <button id="practice-back" class="library-link" onclick="load-scene:Assets/MainMenu.lvl"><img src="img/Esc_Key_Light.png"/><span>Main Menu</span></button>
        <span class="library-heading">PRACTICE</span>
        <button id="practice-library" class="library-link" onclick="load-scene:Assets/TrackList.lvl"><span>Song library</span></button>
    </div>
    <div id="lesson-list" class="library-list">
        <p class="empty-library" data-if="lesson_count == 0">No lessons found. They live in Assets/Practice/Lessons.json.</p>
        <div data-for="lesson : lessons">
            <h2 class="track-category" data-if="lesson.category != ''">{{lesson.category}}</h2>
            <button class="lesson-row" data-class-selected="selected == lesson.index" data-event-click="select(lesson.index)" data-event-focus="select(lesson.index)" data-class-locked="lesson.state == 'LOCKED'"><span class="lesson-name">{{lesson.name}}</span><span class="lesson-state" data-if="lesson.state != ''">{{lesson.state}}</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="library-details" data-if="selected >= 0">
        <div class="detail-copy">
            <h1 id="lesson-name">{{detail_name}}</h1>
            <h2>{{detail_category}}</h2>
            <p>{{detail_description}}</p>
            <p class="lesson-pattern" data-if="detail_pattern != ''">{{detail_pattern}}</p>
            <p class="lesson-key" data-if="detail_pattern != ''">R and L are strokes, r and l quiet taps, ' an accent, f a flam.</p>
            <div class="lesson-lane" data-for="lane : lanes"><span class="lane-name">{{lane.name}}</span><span class="lane-steps">{{lane.steps}}</span></div>
            <p class="lesson-key" data-if="detail_feel != ''">Counted in {{detail_feel}}.</p>
            <div class="lesson-tempo">
                <label>Tempo <span id="lesson-bpm">{{bpm}} BPM</span></label>
                <input id="tempo-slider" type="range" min="40" max="220" step="1" data-value="bpm"/>
                <button id="tempo-down" class="tempo-step" data-event-click="tempo(-5)">- 5</button>
                <button id="tempo-up" class="tempo-step" data-event-click="tempo(5)">+ 5</button>
            </div>
            <div class="lesson-length">
                <label>Length</label>
                <button class="tempo-step" data-class-selected="bars == 8" data-event-click="bars(8)">8 bars</button>
                <button class="tempo-step" data-class-selected="bars == 16" data-event-click="bars(16)">16 bars</button>
                <button class="tempo-step" data-class-selected="bars == 32" data-event-click="bars(32)">32 bars</button>
            </div>
            <p class="lesson-progress" data-class-passed="detail_passed > 0" data-if="detail_progress != ''">{{detail_progress}}</p>
            <button id="lesson-start" class="detail-action green" data-if="detail_locked == 0" data-event-click="start">START</button>
            <p class="detail-state" data-if="status != ''">{{status}}</p>
            <div class="lesson-songs">
                <h3>{{songs_heading}}</h3>
                <div class="lesson-song" data-for="song : songs"><div class="song-copy"><span class="song-name">{{song.name}}</span><span class="song-detail">{{song.detail}}</span></div><button class="song-play" data-event-click="play_song(song.track)">PLAY</button></div>
                <p class="lesson-key" data-if="songs_state != ''">{{songs_state}}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="library-footer">
        <span>A bar of clicks counts you in. The results show whether you sit ahead of the beat or behind it.</span>
        <span>{{lesson_count}} lessons</span>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
